# Epic Quest - The Elemental Challenge
# A showcase of the Cutscene Editor's full capabilities
# Featuring backdrops, portraits, cutins, sound effects, and animations

@backdrop textures/room.gif [fadeIn=800]
@char HERO sprite=characters/male
@char WITCH sprite=characters/female
@char AIR_KNIGHT sprite=npc/air-knight

@do playSfx [name=audio/opening.mp3]

wait 1200

# Scene 1: The Hero's Chamber

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
Another peaceful morning in the kingdom...
Or so I thought.
"""

wait 800

@do playSfx [name=audio/organ.mp3]

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=worried]
"""
What was that sound?!
Something feels wrong...
"""

wait 1000

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=600]

wait 800

# Scene 2: Meeting the Witch

@backdrop textures/sewer.gif [fadeIn=700]
@do playSfx [name=audio/distorted-communication.mp3]

WITCH: [expression=worried,position=right]
"""
Hero! I've been searching for you.
Dark forces are gathering...
"""

HERO: [expression=shocked,position=left]
"""
What do you mean?
What's happening to our land?
"""

*WITCH: [cutin=size=large,expression=annoyed]
"""
The ancient elementals have awakened!
They're testing mortals who dare enter their domains.
We need your courage!
"""

wait 500

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left] I'm ready. Tell me what must be done.

@do playSfx [name=audio/calm-escape.mp3]

WITCH: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
You must face the trial of the Air Knight.
He guards the Path of Winds in the northern dungeon.
"""

wait 1500

@transition wipe [duration=500]

wait 600

# Scene 3: The Air Temple

@backdrop textures/room.png [fadeIn=900]
@do playSfx [name=audio/icy-passage.mp3]

wait 800

AIR_KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Mortal... you have entered the Chamber of Storms.
Few dare to challenge me.
"""

HERO: [expression=worried,position=left]
"""
I seek to prove my worth!
The kingdom needs protection from the darkness.
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/brass-loop.mp3]

*AIR_KNIGHT: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
Brave words! But bravery alone won't save you.
Show me your resolve in combat!
"""

wait 1000

@action HERO moveTo [x=40,duration=600]

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left] Then let the trial begin!

wait 800

@do playSfx [name=audio/dungeon-beat.mp3]

AIR_KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Come forth, warrior!
The winds shall test your spirit!
"""

wait 1200

# Scene 4: The Battle

@backdrop textures/sewer-lava.gif [fadeIn=500]

wait 800

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=shocked]
"""
The power... it's overwhelming!
But I cannot give up now!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/deep-unknown-beat.mp3]

wait 1500

HERO: [expression=tired,position=left]
"""
I... must... keep... fighting...
For everyone depending on me!
"""

wait 1000

@do playSfx [name=audio/calm-escape.mp3]

AIR_KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Enough! You have proven yourself.
Your determination burns brighter than any flame.
"""

wait 800

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=800]

wait 1000

# Scene 5: Victory and Wisdom

@backdrop textures/room.gif [fadeIn=700]
@do playSfx [name=audio/dawns-peak.mp3]

*AIR_KNIGHT: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
You've passed the trial, brave one.
Take this blessing of the winds.
"""

wait 500

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left] Thank you, guardian. What lies ahead?

AIR_KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Three more trials await you:
Fire, Water, and Earth.
"""

wait 800

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=worried]
"""
If this was just the first trial...
How much harder will the others be?
"""

wait 600

AIR_KNIGHT: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Trust in yourself, warrior.
You have the strength within you.
"""

wait 1200

@do playSfx [name=audio/ocean-waves.mp3]

WITCH: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
Well done, hero!
I knew you could do it.
"""

HERO: [expression=smile,position=right]
"""
Thank you for believing in me.
Now, where do we go next?
"""

*WITCH: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
Rest for now. Tomorrow, we journey to the
Temple of Flames in the volcanic south.
"""

wait 1000

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
I'll be ready.
Whatever it takes to protect our home.
"""

wait 1500

@backdrop textures/darkness.gif [fadeIn=1200]

wait 800

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
This is just the beginning of an epic quest...
And I won't face it alone.
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/lonely-mountain.mp3]

wait 2000

@transition wipe [duration=800]

waitInput

@end
